{"parse": {"title": "TMOT-03", "pageid": 8683, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TMOT-02\" title=\"TMOT-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TMOT-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/TMOT-04\" title=\"TMOT-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TMOT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.91.E4.B8.9D.E4.B8.8E.E9.93.85.E7.B2.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"发丝与铅粉\">发丝与铅粉</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 发丝与铅粉</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Golden Hair And The Cerussa</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>束<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>丝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>捧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>铅<span class=\"color-value\"></span>粉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>袋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>利<span class=\"color-value\"></span>齿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190203</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>这不可能！节庆应该是保密的才对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵：</div><div>情况属实！根据回报，骑兵们的目的地就是这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>难不成……是有人向护国公泄露了秘密？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>啊，可悲又可恨的珂麦托【Comaetho】，夺走了我们的发丝，这叫我们如何是好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>怎，怎么办！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>那可是护国公的骑兵……呜呜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>逃走……弄臣先生，我们必须赶快逃走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰弗里深吸了一口气，重新恢复了平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>赶快去通知市长先生，让他想办法去拖住骑兵们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>同时，按照先前的计划，提前结束节庆活动，让演出者们沿着准备好的密道逃走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵：</div><div>遵命！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>正如您听到的，夏利团长还请赶快离开吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>我对此感到非常抱歉，出现这种情况，是我们都不愿意看见的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰弗里：</div><div>要是被骑兵发现你们的行踪，可就麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>弄臣先生，我们必须立刻通知大家离开这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>否则要不了多久，我们就会被追上的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>夏利团长，您所言极是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>追兵们会以最快的速度追上我们，绞死我们，将我们的尸骸高悬于旗杆之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>“届时，鸦群将会分食我们的皮肉，像是一场最为神圣的仪式。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>何等不堪的结尾，可真教人害怕——还是尽早逃跑为妙。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>距离演出预定开始的时间所剩无几，两人返回剧团时，众人正在进行最终的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅰ：</div><div>团长？弄臣？你们怎么回来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>各位……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剧团成员们对即将发生的事情一无所知，仍旧沉浸在欢乐的氛围之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅱ：</div><div>你们回来得正好，大家已经准备好演出所需要的东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅰ：</div><div>就差你们了，哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>演出服被珍重地从箱中取出，连同着化妆品一起被传递到每个人的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>哎呀哎呀，真是一派喜庆的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>这也难怪，任何演员都应当为即将登上的舞台而激动欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>只可惜，他们还未曾意识到，命运是一只泥泞的手掌，将会给予人们以失落的滋味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>各位，请听我说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低弱的声音在被众人注意到之前，就已经被淹没在了热切的讨论之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅰ：</div><div>要我说，这次的剧目保准会让所有观众大吃一惊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅱ：</div><div>——虽然这次舞台的条件有点简陋得过了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿，你可真挑剔。现在这个年头，有机会给你表演就不错了，别挑挑拣拣的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-561401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅱ：</div><div>我可没挑剔！我昨晚一直没睡好，就是期待着今天的表演呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-561301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">剧团成员Ⅰ：</div><div>看出来了，铅粉都没遮住你的黑眼圈——再多抹点，别让观众看出来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>化妆时扬起的铅粉在烛光下熠熠生辉，将夏利想要说出来的话又重新推回了嘴里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弄臣：</div><div>您在犹豫什么，夏利团长？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面具上露出了一个诡异的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它带着嘲弄，带着讽刺——这是不应该属于“弄臣”的情绪。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TMOT-03"}}